description = "Independent module S6: deformation functors of dg Lie algebras over a prime field — Maurer-Cartan equation, curvature and Bianchi identity, twisted differential, order-by-order moduli tower with obstruction classes and refined obstructions, Kuranishi map; cochain complexes, derived (homotopy) fiber products and their Mayer-Vietoris sequence"
